  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson NXT Duramax 16 combines the signature comfort of the NXT family with enhanced durability through Abrasion Shields technology. Its PU-bonded multifilament construction preserves power, spin and feel while resisting premature string breakage. Compared with Duramax 15, the thinner 1.32 mm gauge delivers slightly more power and feel while maintaining excellent durability.",

    "zh": "Wilson NXT Duramax 16 是 NXT 系列中兼顾舒适性与耐打性的版本，采用 Abrasion Shields（耐磨护盾）强化 PU 多芯结构，有效提高抗磨损和抗断线能力，同时保留 NXT 系列一贯的力量、旋转和舒适击球感。相比 Duramax 15，1.32 毫米线径带来更好的力量输出和手感，同时仍具有非常优秀的耐久表现。"
  },

